00:55:54.450 --> 00:55:55.710
which they have done many times.

00:55:55.710 --> 00:55:56.760
- Oh really?
- Yeah.

00:55:56.760 --> 00:55:58.053
They do, so now I just eat everything.

00:55:58.053 --> 00:56:00.570
- I just eat everything.
- I eat everything,

00:56:00.570 --> 00:56:02.940
but originally when I
didn't eat something,

00:56:02.940 --> 00:56:04.087
they would sometimes just
stare at me and be like,

00:56:04.087 --> 00:56:05.940
