00:56:09.157 --> 00:56:10.613
- "Are you sick? Do you have COVID?

00:56:10.613 --> 00:56:12.037
Are you dying?"

00:56:12.037 --> 00:56:14.109
- "I will find you."
- "I will kill you."

00:56:14.109 --> 00:56:15.660
- Best advice. Best advice you get.

00:56:15.660 --> 00:56:16.810
- Pillow over the face.

00:56:18.854 --> 00:56:20.871
- That's something you
feel so intimidated.

00:56:20.871 --> 00:56:25.830
But no, I'd even recommend going to ryokan

00:56:25.830 --> 00:56:28.380
