01:55:03.654 --> 01:55:04.766
- Yeah.
- I understand it's a tall,

01:55:04.766 --> 01:55:05.599
a tall ask.
- But I think

01:55:05.599 --> 01:55:07.470
for the most part, if you are in Tokyo,

01:55:07.470 --> 01:55:09.960
the train system is just so convenient.

01:55:09.960 --> 01:55:10.793
You probably-
- Google Maps.

01:55:10.793 --> 01:55:12.100
