01:55:22.183 --> 01:55:23.963
I wish that people would
shut up being like,

01:55:23.963 --> 01:55:25.650
"I know the streets better."

01:55:25.650 --> 01:55:26.483
No, you don't.

01:55:26.483 --> 01:55:29.520
