01:56:17.370 --> 01:56:18.360
- Kyushu is great.

01:56:18.360 --> 01:56:21.450
I think Kyushu is underrated as hell.

01:56:21.450 --> 01:56:22.283
- [Garnt] Yeah.

01:56:22.283 --> 01:56:26.507
- One place I really, really
liked in Kyushu was Kumamoto.

01:56:26.507 --> 01:56:27.340
- Yeah.
- Mm-hmm.

01:56:27.340 --> 01:56:30.630
- The Kumamoto, yeah,
where Aso is, the volcano.

01:56:30.630 --> 01:56:31.710
Mount Aso is.
- Yeah.

01:56:31.710 --> 01:56:33.690
