01:57:14.670 --> 01:57:15.970
- I've always wanted to go.
- Yeah, it's really cool.

01:57:15.970 --> 01:57:18.060
- Yeah, I still haven't
been to Kyushu as well.

01:57:18.060 --> 01:57:19.110
