01:57:49.110 --> 01:57:51.090
like me and Sydney are,

01:57:51.090 --> 01:57:53.070
you can go to the wine capital of Japan,

01:57:53.070 --> 01:57:55.350
even though wine's not as well known here.

01:57:55.350 --> 01:57:57.000
But I mean, we discovered the place

01:57:57.000 --> 01:57:59.730
because we're not, I'm not a big sake fan.

01:57:59.730 --> 01:58:01.080
I'm not a massive sake fan,

01:58:01.080 --> 01:58:04.380
but there are plenty of
places to try sake in Tokyo,

01:58:04.380 --> 01:58:06.000
and basically anywhere you go into Japan,

01:58:06.000 --> 01:58:07.740
