- If you wanted to.

01:58:18.113 --> 01:58:22.410
It's just about an hour an
hour and a half out of Tokyo,

01:58:22.410 --> 01:58:24.390
you can literally just go on the JR line

01:58:24.390 --> 01:58:28.050
and go to the stops around Koshu Valley.

01:58:28.050 --> 01:58:31.200
There is one place I do
recommend if you are interested.

01:58:31.200 --> 01:58:34.630
I believe the building is
called Budou-kyo, I think.

01:58:34.630 --> 01:58:37.170
- Budou-kyo.
- Yeah.

01:58:37.170 --> 01:58:39.239
- Grape Hill.
- Yeah, yeah. Grape Hill.

01:58:39.239 --> 01:58:40.680
- It's good to do Grape Hill.

01:58:40.680 --> 01:58:41.790
- I believe that's the place,

01:58:41.790 --> 01:58:43.860
because that's the place
I've talked about before,

01:58:43.860 --> 01:58:47.040
