01:58:53.940 --> 01:58:56.512
and that's it.
- It's self pour.

01:58:56.512 --> 01:58:57.556
- It's self pour.

01:58:57.556 --> 01:59:00.150
They give you a little cup

01:59:00.150 --> 01:59:02.820
and you can try as many wines as you like.

01:59:02.820 --> 01:59:05.640
There's little bowls where
you can spit out the wine,

01:59:05.640 --> 01:59:07.553
if you don't like the taste of the wine.

01:59:08.469 --> 01:59:10.770
- Especially if it's just 13
bucks to get munted on wine.

01:59:10.770 --> 01:59:13.590
- Yeah, I've done it, I've done
it plenty of fucking times.

01:59:13.590 --> 01:59:15.420
It's a really, really good experience,

01:59:15.420 --> 01:59:18.040
