entire view of Koshu Valley

01:59:21.060 --> 01:59:24.450
and you can see all the grape
farms, and all the grapevines.

01:59:24.450 --> 01:59:25.650
- Mm.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

01:59:25.650 --> 01:59:26.483
- Yeah, yeah.
- Oh, that's cool.

01:59:26.483 --> 01:59:28.050
That doesn't look like Japan.

01:59:28.050 --> 01:59:31.470
- Yeah, it's got such a good fucking view

01:59:31.470 --> 01:59:34.530
and me and Sydney go
there for a yearly trip

01:59:34.530 --> 01:59:36.030
to try out the different wines there

01:59:36.030 --> 01:59:37.380
that come out every year.

01:59:37.380 --> 01:59:39.147
- Yeah, you can, I think I drove there,

01:59:39.147 --> 01:59:40.950
and there's decent parking.

01:59:40.950 --> 01:59:43.163
- But if you do like saki,
I would recommend Nigata.

01:59:43.163 --> 01:59:44.117
- Nigata. Ah, yes.

01:59:44.117 --> 01:59:47.021
- Nigata is like the capital of saki,

01:59:47.021 --> 01:59:48.870
and rice fields and stuff.

01:59:48.870 --> 01:59:50.820
I went to a similar thing,

01:59:50.820 --> 01:59:52.000
like to the wine thing.
- Vending machines?

01:59:52.000 --> 01:59:55.350
- Except it was all
sake, for like 20 bucks.

01:59:55.350 --> 01:59:56.400
- Were there vending machines?
- And you could taste test.

01:59:56.400 --> 01:59:57.990
Yeah, the vending machine.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

01:59:57.990 --> 01:59:58.980
- There's two stations that have it.

01:59:58.980 --> 01:59:59.813
- Yeah.

01:59:59.813 --> 02:00:01.620
It's basically all around Nigata,

02:00:01.620 --> 02:00:05.025
