02:00:08.776 --> 02:00:11.100
- But also, in the
Nigata vending machines,

02:00:11.100 --> 02:00:13.562
there's also umeshu, plum wine.

02:00:13.562 --> 02:00:14.475
- Ooh, yeah.
- Really good.

02:00:14.475 --> 02:00:15.450
- They do really good plum wine.

02:00:15.450 --> 02:00:17.974
- 'Cause I don't like sake,
so I always go to the umeshu,

02:00:17.974 --> 02:00:20.493
which is like nectar of the gods.

02:00:21.420 --> 02:00:22.253
It's wonderful.

02:00:22.253 --> 02:00:24.600
It's just like sugary goodness.

02:00:24.600 --> 02:00:25.433
Oh, it's so good.
It's very good.

02:00:25.433 --> 02:00:27.090
- It's so bad for you though.

02:00:27.090 --> 02:00:28.500
- Yeah.
- It's like 100% sugar.

02:00:28.500 --> 02:00:31.170
- Fortunately umeshu is a
bit too sweet for my pallet.

02:00:31.170 --> 02:00:32.640
otherwise I probably would like it more.

02:00:32.640 --> 02:00:34.380
