02:00:34.380 --> 02:00:35.213
you mix it with something like soda.

02:00:35.213 --> 02:00:36.299
- Soda. Oh, god.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

02:00:36.299 --> 02:00:39.481
- I mean, Nigata, I've been there a bunch.

02:00:39.481 --> 02:00:41.128
It's okay.

